@token = token$abroso

### Consulta
GET http://localhost:3200/api/location/?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### Creacion
POST http://localhost:3200/api/location/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: barer {{token}}

{
    "address": "Address 1",
    "telephone": "12345678944",
    "latitude": 1.13,
    "longitude": 1.14
}

### Actualizacion
PUT http://localhost:3200/api/location/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization:  barer {{token}}

{
    "address": "Otra dirección",
    "telephone": "12345678944",
    "active": true,
    "latitude": 1.13,
    "longitude": 1.14,
    "id": 4
}

### Eliminacion
DELETE http://localhost:3200/api/location/7
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization : barer {{token}}

